# OMC state, ignored in full. This directory previously carried two negations,
# `!.omc/specs/` and `!.omc/plans/`, so that the interview spec and the execution
# plan — the decision provenance the ADRs cite — were committed on purpose. Both
# documents were relocated to the private repository when this one was reduced to
# its public, local shape (ADR 0023); `docs/adr/README.md` § Provenance says where
# they live and at which commit. The negations are removed with them: planning
# artefacts here routinely carry absolute local paths and commercial detail, and a
# public repository is the wrong place for them to land by default.
.omc/
